es/2886#issuecomment-4125863325", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/2886", "id": 4125863325, "node_id": "IC_kwDOPRF1G871662d", "user": {"login": "ygd58", "id": 78954051, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjc4OTU0MDUx", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78954051?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/ygd58", "html_url": "https://github.com/ygd58", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ygd58/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ygd58/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ygd58/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ygd58/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ygd58/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ygd58/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ygd58/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ygd58/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ygd58/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2026-03-25T11:32:24Z", "updated_at": "2026-03-25T11:32:24Z", "body": "Could you share the full traceback? Run hermes with verbose logging:\n\nhermes --verbose\n\nThen paste the full error output. The 'NoneType strip' error could be in many places \u2014 we need the stack trace to identify the root cause.\n", "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4125863325/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4323602401", "html_url": "https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/2886#issuecomment-4323602401", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/2886", "id": 4323602401, "node_id": "IC_kwDOPRF1G88AAAABAbTv4Q", "user": {"login": "teknium1", "id": 127238744, "node_id": "U_kgDOB5WCWA", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127238744?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1", "html_url": "https://github.com/teknium1", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/teknium1/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2026-04-27T01:22:50Z", "updated_at": "2026-04-27T01:22:50Z", "body": "Thanks for the report \u2014 this is fixed in **v0.5.0** (released 2026-03-28).\n\nThis was an automated [hermes-sweeper](https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent) review.\n\n**Root cause & fix:**\n- When a YAML config key is present but has no value (e.g. `model:` with nothing after it), Python's YAML parser returns `None`. `dict.get(key, \"\")` only falls back to `\"\"` when the key is *absent* \u2014 it returns `None` when the key exists with a null value. Calling `.strip()` on `None` crashes with the exact error reported.\n- Fixed in commit `be39292` (PR #3552): changed all affected callsites in `cli.py`, `hermes_cli/main.py`, and `hermes_cli/runtime_provider.py` to use `(cfg.get(key) or \"\").strip()`.\n\n**Evidence:**\n- `be392926` \u2014 `fix(cli): guard .strip() against None values from YAML config (#3552)`\n- Ships in tag `v2026.3.28` / v0.5.0\n\nPlease upgrade with `hermes update` and reopen if the issue persists.", "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4323602401/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}]